<h2>1. What EchoX is</h2>
<p>
  EchoX is a free, browser-based music and video player. It streams full tracks from Audius,
  30-second previews from Deezer and Apple's iTunes Search API, podcast episodes from Apple
  Podcasts, live radio from Radio Browser and music videos from YouTube through YouTube's
  embedded player. EchoX does not host, upload, store or redistribute any music or video files;
  playback happens directly from those third-party services.
</p>

